    "detailed_description": "<h1>[FREE] Open to public</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to the bad press as well as the decline in development and staff over the past few years, I've decided to open Discord bot workshop to the public as a <strong>free product.</strong> Please enjoy using it.</p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[EARLY ACCESS]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Discord bots faster, smarter, easier with Discord Bot Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DBW is a way for intermediates to work with an simpler and more intuitive workspace than a regular IDE to create custom discord bots with ease with the very latest Discord features like buttons, dropdowns and even context menus.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord bot workshop is the most advanced discord bot creator right now holding over 300 unique features in a simple infinite flowchart based node editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Think something is limited?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily create your own features with Mods! Mods can be created to add extra features to the app when needed and also many are already available for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also create custom commands and nodes using JS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Want to share a command?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can do this in seconds with our raw data feature. In just 2 button presses you can share your commands worldwide with anyone you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Embed creating with realistic embed previews</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Image creating </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Almost every Discord event (member join, member leave etc)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Music features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spreadsheet reading and writing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Custom code blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Reaction nodes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Dropdowns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Context Menus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Function calling and creating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Guild only prefixes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Looping actions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Leaderboard creating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+ over 200 more features</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[EARLY ACCESS]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make Discord bots faster, smarter, easier with Discord Bot Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DBW is a way for intermediates to work with an simpler and more intuitive workspace than a regular IDE to create custom discord bots with ease with the very latest Discord features like buttons, dropdowns and even context menus.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord bot workshop is the most advanced discord bot creator right now holding over 300 unique features in a simple infinite flowchart based node editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Think something is limited?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily create your own features with Mods! Mods can be created to add extra features to the app when needed and also many are already available for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also create custom commands and nodes using JS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Want to share a command?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can do this in seconds with our raw data feature. In just 2 button presses you can share your commands worldwide with anyone you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Embed creating with realistic embed previews</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Image creating </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Almost every Discord event (member join, member leave etc)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Music features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spreadsheet reading and writing </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Custom code blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Reaction nodes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Dropdowns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discord Context Menus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Function calling and creating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Guild only prefixes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Looping actions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Leaderboard creating</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">+ over 200 more features</p>",
